## Key Features Summary

| Feature | Tool | Use Case |
|---------|------|----------|
| 📁 File Discovery | `search_files_by_name` | Find files by name pattern |
| 🔍 Text Search | `search_code_content` | Find functions, classes, strings |
| 📖 File Reading | `get_file_content` | Read specific files |
| 🌳 Structure | `get_directory_structure` | Understand project layout |
| 🎯 Regex Search | `search_by_regex` | Complex pattern matching |
| 🧠 Semantic | `semantic_search_with_embeddings` | Meaning-based search |

The agent uses an **agentic loop** - it keeps searching and reading files until it has enough information to answer your question completely!

